        "IsOptionalInPortsCollapsed": false,
        "IsUnconnectedOutPortsCollapsed": false,
        "HasToggledOptionalInPorts": false,
        "HasToggledUnconnectedOutPorts": false,
        "Background": "#FFC1D676"
      },
      {
        "Id": "25d9067b04d24d05b940e661f6a49a4e",
        "Title": "Object collections\r\nThere are many sub-objects to the Sheet Set.\r\nSee the appropriate samples for handling these types of objects.",
